---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import openScienceBadge from "../images/badges/nasa-open-science-101.png";
---

<MainLayout>
    <section id="background" class="section section-alt">
        <div class="container">
            <header class="about-header">
                <h1>About</h1>

                <p>
                    I am an undergraduate student in Astronomical and Planetary
                    Science with a concentration in Astrophysics at Arizona State
                    University. My interests include observational astronomy,
                    planetary science, scientific computing, and astronomical
                    instrumentation.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This website documents my transition from professional software
                    engineering to astronomy through academic study, observational
                    work, outreach, and technical projects.
                </p>
            </header>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>My Journey</h2>

                <p>
                    Before returning to university to study astronomy, I earned a
                    bachelor's degree in Information Technology and spent more than
                    six years working as a professional frontend software engineer.
                    During that time, astronomy remained a consistent part of my life
                    through visual observing, astronomical imaging, and public
                    outreach.
                </p>

                <p>
                    As my involvement in astronomy grew, I realized that I wanted to
                    contribute more directly to the field rather than participate
                    solely as a hobbyist. Returning to university was a deliberate
                    decision to build the scientific foundation necessary for
                    research and, ultimately, graduate study.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Research Interests</h2>

                <p>
                    My primary interests lie in planetary science, particularly the
                    study of planetary surfaces and their evolution through
                    observational techniques and image analysis. I am also interested
                    in lunar science, solar observations, astronomical
                    instrumentation, and scientific computing.
                </p>

                <p>
                    My background in software engineering has shaped my interest in
                    developing computational tools that support astronomy through
                    data analysis, visualization, automation, and reproducible
                    scientific workflows. During my undergraduate studies, I hope to
                    combine computational methods with observational work while
                    preparing for future research in planetary science or
                    astrophysics.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Education</h2>

                <div class="about-grid">
                    <article>
                        <h3>Arizona State University</h3>

                        <p>
                            Bachelor of Science in Astronomical and Planetary Science
                            <br />
                            Concentration in Astrophysics
                            <br />
                            Expected Graduation: Fall 2028
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article>
                        <h3>Kennesaw State University</h3>

                        <p>
                            Bachelor of Science in Information Technology
                            <br />
                            Concentration in Mobile and Web Development
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Professional Experience</h2>

                <div class="about-grid">
                    <article>
                        <h3>Astronomical League</h3>

                        <p>
                            I serve as Assistant Webmaster for the Astronomical
                            League, supporting the organization's website and digital
                            communications.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article>
                        <h3>Software Engineering</h3>

                        <p>
                            I have more than six years of professional experience
                            designing and developing websites, web applications, and
                            digital experiences. This technical background now
                            supports my interests in scientific computing, astronomy
                            software, and research-oriented workflows.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Astronomy &amp; Outreach</h2>

                <div class="about-grid">
                    <article>
                        <h3>Observational Astronomy</h3>

                        <p>
                            I have more than six years of experience in observational
                            astronomy, including solar, lunar, planetary, and
                            deep-sky observing and imaging. My work has involved a
                            variety of telescopes, astronomical cameras, filters, and
                            related instrumentation, along with participation in
                            Astronomical League observing programs.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article>
                        <h3>Science Communication</h3>

                        <p>
                            I enjoy communicating astronomy to public audiences
                            through presentations and STEM outreach. I have presented
                            four public astronomy talks and participated in outreach
                            events for schools and community organizations,
                            contributing more than 60 hours of volunteer outreach.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Professional Development</h2>

                <div class="credential">
                    <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/99ed2c54-b36f-4ea8-861a-f83c0d8b9d8f/public_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <img
    src={openScienceBadge.src}
    width={openScienceBadge.width}
    height={openScienceBadge.height}
    alt="NASA Open Science 101 digital badge"
    class="credential-image"
/>
                    </a>

                    <div class="credential-content">
                        <h3>NASA Open Science 101</h3>

                        <p class="credential-meta">
                            Completed August 2025
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Completed NASA Open Science 101, a professional development
                            course covering open science principles, FAIR data practices,
                            reproducible research, and collaborative scientific workflows.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
    .about-header {
        max-width: 75ch;
    }

    .about-section {
        margin-top: 3.5rem;
    }

    .about-section > p {
        max-width: 75ch;
    }

    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-grid article,
    .credential {
        max-width: 65ch;
    }

    .about-grid h3,
    .credential h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .credential {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
}

.credential-image {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 160px;
    height: auto;
}

.credential-content {
    flex: 1;
}

.credential-meta {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .credential {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .credential-image {
        width: 140px;
    }
}

    @media (min-width: 800px) {
        .about-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }
    }
</style>